# Fulldev UI Patterns

## Installing Components

Never manually create files in `src/components/ui/`. Always install via CLI:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @fulldev/[component-name]
# Examples:
npx shadcn@latest add @fulldev/button
npx shadcn@latest add @fulldev/section
npx shadcn@latest add @fulldev/tile
# Install everything at once:
npx shadcn@latest add @fulldev/components
npx shadcn@latest add @fulldev/blocks
```

