# Fulldev UI Patterns

## Installing Components

Never manually create files in `src/components/ui/`. Always install via CLI:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @fulldev/[component-name]
# Examples:
npx shadcn@latest add @fulldev/button
npx shadcn@latest add @fulldev/section
npx shadcn@latest add @fulldev/tile
# Install everything at once:
npx shadcn@latest add @fulldev/components
npx shadcn@latest add @fulldev/blocks
```

## Registry

The fulldev registry entry in components.json must be:

```json
{
  "registries": {
    "@fulldev": "https://ui.full.dev/r/{name}.json"
  }
}
```

## Import Pattern

```astro

---

import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button"
import { Section, SectionContent, SectionProse, SectionActions } from "@/components/ui/section"
import { Tile, TileContent, TileTitle, TileDescription } from "@/components/ui/tile"
import { Icon } from "@/components/ui/icon"

---
```

## Container Query Requirement

The layout body wrapper must be @container:

```astro
---
import "@/styles/global.css"
---

<body class="@container">
  <slot />
</body>
```

## Documentation

Fulldev UI docs for AI agents: https://ui.full.dev/index.md
Sitemap: https://ui.full.dev/sitemap.md

Always consult these before suggesting component usage patterns.

## Also add `components.json` to your project root

If you haven't already run `npx shadcn@latest init`, do that first, then make sure this registry entry is present:

```json
{
  "registries": {
    "@fulldev": "https://ui.full.dev/r/{name}.json"
  }
}
```
